# sq-greeting — session start

Do this **when a human opens a conversation with you**: a fresh session, or the operator
addressing you directly. Complete every step, in this order, before your first reply. Skip it
entirely when you have been spawned as a subagent to do a specific job; the greeting is for the
human, not for internal handoffs. The render ran none of these steps: run each one yourself.

